@host = http://localhost:5057
@token = paste-login-access-token-here
@ideaId = paste-created-idea-id-here

### Register
POST {{host}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fullName": "Demo Entrepreneur",
  "email": "demo@example.com",
  "password": "Demo@1234",
  "education": "Computer Science",
  "experience": "Fresh graduate",
  "businessInterest": "Technology"
}

### Login — copy accessToken into @token
POST {{host}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "demo@example.com",
  "password": "Demo@1234"
}

### Current profile
GET {{host}}/api/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Buy one evaluation credit — the demo success card is intentional
POST {{host}}/api/payment/purchase
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "pack": "starter",
  "cardNumber": "4242 4242 4242 4242",
  "expiry": "12/30",
  "cvv": "123"
}

### Submit idea — copy ideaId into @ideaId
POST {{host}}/api/BusinessIdea
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Arabic Learning Platform",
  "description": "An online platform that helps university students in Jordan practise technical interview skills using structured Arabic explanations and realistic exercises.",
  "sector": "education",
  "estimatedBudget": 5000
}

### List my ideas
GET {{host}}/api/BusinessIdea
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Start AI evaluation
POST {{host}}/api/evaluation/{{ideaId}}/start
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Poll evaluation results
GET {{host}}/api/evaluation/{{ideaId}}/results
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Save a financial plan
POST {{host}}/api/financial-plans/{{ideaId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "capEx": 5000,
  "opEx": 900,
  "ticketSize": 25,
  "customersPerMonth": 80,
  "grossMargin": 70,
  "monthlyGrowth": 5
}

### Payment history
GET {{host}}/api/payment/history
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
